The clear water washes into the bucket.	清澈的湖水流進水桶裡。
The lake's water is very refreshing.	湖水清涼宜人。
These cattails are soft and fuzzy.	這些香蒲又軟又蓬鬆。
It seems the old goat has wandered off by himself and is no longer following you.	看來老山羊自己遊蕩走開了，不再跟著你了。
You drink of the clear lake water.	你喝了清澈的湖水。
These cattails are fuzzy and soft.	這些香蒲又蓬鬆又軟。
Inside the old, rotted stump you notice a small, canvas pouch.	在這個老舊腐朽的樹樁裡，你發現一個帆布做的小皮袋。
You notice the pouch feels aged and tattered.	你發現這個皮袋摸起來又舊又破。
You could get a much better look at it if it were in your  hands.	要是拿在手裡，你能看得更清楚。
From here you can see the stump is very old and nearly petrified.	從這裡你看得出這個樹樁十分古老，幾乎已經石化了。
You can vaguely see the stump in the distance.	你只能隱約看見遠方的那個樹樁。
It is only a rotted log.	那只是一段腐朽的木頭。
I suggest you move closer to try that.	我建議你走近一點再試試看。
You need to get closer to look at the log.	你得靠近一點才能看清那段木頭。
There is nothing in the old log.	這段老舊的木頭裡什麼也沒有。
The beans immediately sprout roots that reach deep into the fertile soil... leaves unfold themselves to the warm, loving sun... a rumbling is felt... and a mighty beanstalk now stretches up into the sky!	魔豆立刻生根，深深扎進肥沃的土壤……葉片舒展，迎向溫暖和煦的陽光……接著感到一陣隆隆震動……一株雄偉的豆莖破土而出，直衝天際！
You can't reach the beanstalk from here.	你在這裡搆不到豆莖。
There is no beanstalk here to climb.	這裡沒有豆莖可以爬。
Ouch!	哎呦！
You are in the forest.  You can see a stump and a hollow log here.	你身處森林之中。這裡可以看見一個樹樁和一段中空的木頭。
The lake's waters pour into the bucket.	湖水注入水桶裡。
The clear water quenches your thirst.	清澈的湖水解了你的渴。
You are not close enough to the lake.	你離湖水不夠近。
You might try that at the lake.	你或許可以到湖邊試試看。
There is a small waterfall splashing nearby.	附近有一道小瀑布飛濺著水花。
The swift water pulls you down to your untimely demise.	湍急的水流把你捲入水中，你就此枉送性命。
A rapidly flowing stream is pouring into this lake.	一道湍急的溪流注入這座湖泊。
The bucket is soon filled with clear water.	水桶很快就裝滿了清澈的水。
The water is clear and refreshing.	湖水清澈又清涼。
A rapidly moving stream is flowing out of this lake.	一道湍急的溪流從這座湖泊流出。
"Gentle Sir Graham, I am your fairy godmother.  Your quest is indeed noble.  My small part to aid you can be no bigger than this magic spell, protective but for a little while."	溫柔的格拉漢爵士，我是你的教母。你的冒險確實高尚。我能為你盡的一份心力，就只是這道守護魔法，而且效力不會維持太久。
"I will be watching over you, Sir Graham."	我會看顧著你的，格拉漢爵士。
There is no reason to jump or duck here.	這裡沒有理由跳躍或蹲下。
The goat is wandering this way and that.	山羊正東晃西晃地遊蕩。
It is rather high.  Probably the only way to get in is through the gate.	這裡相當高，要進去大概只能走那道閘門。
You can't carry a goat very far.	你沒辦法把山羊扛得太遠。
That is not something the old goat wants to eat.	那不是老山羊想吃的東西。
You do not have the carrot.	你身上沒有胡蘿蔔。
From here it will be difficult to do such a terrible  thing.	從這裡很難做出這麼可怕的事。
You have no way to accomplish such a terrible deed.	你沒有辦法完成這麼可怕的行為。
The goat is following you.	山羊正跟著你。
The goat will not let you catch him.	山羊不讓你抓到牠。
There is no gate right here.	這裡沒有閘門。
There should be a gate around here somewhere.	這附近應該有一道閘門。
The old goat refuses to listen to you.	老山羊不肯聽你的話。
The goat refuses to listen to your words.	山羊不肯聽你說的話。
Lying lifeless on the ground you see a useless dead  goat.	你看見地上躺著一隻已死、毫無用處的山羊。
You do not want to carry around a dead goat.	你不想扛著一隻死山羊到處走。
You get no response from the goat.	山羊沒有任何反應。
You see a grey billy goat inside the pen.	你看見圍欄裡有一隻灰色的公山羊。
This looks like an area in which to keep animals.	這裡看起來像是關養動物的地方。
It's not nice to tease the goat.  You're not leaving without him.	捉弄山羊可不太好，沒有牠，你是不會離開的。
The gate is rather heavy, but you manage to open it.	閘門相當沉重，但你還是設法把它打開了。
You find the gate is much easier to close than it was to open.	你發現關上閘門比打開它容易多了。
You cannot reach the gate from here.	你在這裡搆不到閘門。
The gate is closed.	閘門是關著的。
The gate is open.	閘門是開著的。
The goat is pacing to and fro.	山羊來回踱著步。
It is high enough to keep animals inside.	這道欄杆高得足以把動物關在裡面。
It would be rather difficult to carry this goat.	要扛著這隻山羊會相當困難。
The old goat is already following you.	老山羊已經在跟著你了。
You have nothing the old goat wants to eat.	你身上沒有老山羊想吃的東西。
Goats love carrots!  The goat quickly devours yours.	山羊最愛胡蘿蔔了！山羊很快就把你的胡蘿蔔吃光了。
From here it will be very difficult to do such a  terrible thing.	從這裡要做出這麼可怕的事非常困難。
You have no way to accomplish this terrible deed.	你沒有辦法完成這件可怕的行為。
The old goat's on the other side of the fence!	老山羊在欄杆的另一邊！
The goat is following you already.	山羊已經跟著你了。
Why would you want to do that?  There is a gate.	你為什麼要這麼做？這裡明明有一道閘門。
Lying lifeless on the ground you see a dead goat.	你看見地上躺著一隻死去的山羊。
The goat shows some interest in the carrot.	山羊對胡蘿蔔顯得有些興趣。
It seems the old goat has wandered off.	看來老山羊已經遊蕩走開了。
You will have to move out of the way so the gate can close all the way.	你得先讓開，閘門才能完全關上。
There is no need to close the gate now.	現在沒有必要關上閘門。
The rope is securely fastened to the well.	繩索牢牢地繫在井上。
You cut a piece of rope and it falls into the well.	你割下一段繩索，繩子掉進了井裡。
With the rope cut, you are able to take the bucket.	繩索割斷後，你就能拿走水桶了。
The bucket and rope are now at the bottom of the well.	水桶和繩索現在都在井底了。
You are not close enough to even try.	你離得不夠近，連試都不能試。
You will need longer arms to cut that rope from here.	你得有更長的手臂，才能從這裡割斷那條繩索。
The bucket is already gone.	水桶已經不見了。
The well is deep and dark. But you can see the sky's reflection on the water.	這口井又深又暗，不過你能看見水面上倒映著天空。
It is large, old and weathered.  It has served the kingdom for many years.	它又大又老，飽經風霜，已為王國服務多年。
The old bucket holds a full load of water.	這個舊水桶裝滿了滿滿的水。
It is thick and firmly attached.  It could easily carry heavy weights.	它又粗又牢固，輕輕鬆鬆就能承受重物。
This well is one of the most ancient sites in the entire kingdom.  History and mystery seem to echo from its  every stone.	這口井是整個王國裡最古老的地點之一，每一塊石頭似乎都迴盪著歷史與神秘的氣息。
From this distance it is difficult to see.	隔著這段距離很難看清楚。
The old bucket is already at the bottom of the well.	舊水桶已經在井底了。
The bucket is already at the top of the well.	這個舊水桶已經在井口了。
The old bucket emerges from the depths of the well.	舊水桶從井底深處浮現上來。
The rope has already been lowered.	繩索已經放下去了。
The rope descends into the darkness.	繩索垂降進入黑暗之中。
The old bucket vanishes into the depths of the well.	舊水桶消失在井底深處。
The rope emerges from the well.	繩索從井裡浮現出來。
You can't raise the rope from here!	你沒辦法從這裡把繩索拉起來！
The old bucket is lifted from the well.	舊水桶被從井裡吊了起來。
You are not close enough to do that.	你離得不夠近，沒辦法這麼做。
The rope does not go down the well very far.	繩索沒有垂進井裡多遠。
What a mistake you made!  This well is too deep to jump into.	你可犯了個大錯！這口井深得跳不下去。
The goat sure doesn't want to climb the rope.	山羊當然不想爬繩索。
The goat sure doesn`t want to climb down the well with you.	山羊當然不想跟你一起爬下井去。
The goat refuses to do down the well.	山羊不肯下到井裡去。
The goat refuses to enter the dark well.	山羊不肯進入那口黑暗的井。
The goat refuses to go down into the dark well.	山羊不肯下到那口黑暗的井裡去。
The goat doesn`t want to slide down the rope.	山羊不想沿著繩索滑下去。
The goat is afraid of heights and refuses to jump down the well.	山羊有懼高症，不肯跳下井去。
Carefully... Oh no!  The sides were too slippery... you've fallen into the well!	小心翼翼……噢不！井壁太滑了……你掉進井裡了！
Somebody has cut the rope;  there's no way for you to get the bucket to the well's bottom.	有人把繩索割斷了，你沒辦法把水桶弄到井底去。
Sorry, all the water is at the bottom of the well.	抱歉，所有的水都在井底。
The long piece of rope falls to the bottom of the well.	那條長繩落到了井底。
There is no useful rope left to cut.	已經沒有可用的繩索可以割了。
There is no useful rope to get.	沒有可用的繩索可以拿。
You should be more careful the next time you try  climbing ropes.	下次爬繩索時你應該更小心一點。
There is not enough rope left to lower.	剩下的繩索不夠放下去了。
Look out for that wolf -- he can run very fast!   Don't let him catch you!	小心那隻狼——牠跑得非常快！別讓牠追上你！
You are very fortunate that your protective spell is still working.	算你走運，你的守護魔法還在發揮作用。
Fortunately, you are invisible and the wolf can't see you.	幸好你是隱形的，狼看不見你。
The wolf sees that menacing goat by your side and decides to keep his distance.	狼看見你身旁那隻兇猛的山羊，便決定保持距離。
You, fortunately, have the magic shield which will protect you.	幸好你有靈盾保護著你。
Yes, it's a wolf and it's very fast.  Now do something!	沒錯，是一隻狼，而且跑得非常快，快做點什麼！
You don't have time to do that right now!	你現在沒時間做那件事！
It seems the wolf caught up with you and is discussing dinner arrangements.	看來狼追上你了，正在盤算晚餐的安排。
Are you crazy?	你瘋了嗎？
There's no wolf here.	這裡沒有狼。
Now that the goat is gone, you'll have to take care of yourself!	山羊已經不在了，你得自己保護自己了！
The wolf is in no mood for conversion.	狼沒心情跟你聊天。
This is a very pretty maple tree.	這是一棵非常漂亮的楓樹。
This is a very large oak tree with branches stretching to the sky.	這是一棵非常高大的橡樹，枝椏伸向天際。
You can't climb a tree here!	你在這裡沒辦法爬樹！
This tree is too hard to climb.	這棵樹太難爬了。
OK	確定
